# ── Terraform ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Provider caches and state are local-only: state carries resource IDs and
# (for some providers) sensitive values. tfvars carry your project IDs, SSH
# keys and source CIDRs. Commit the *.tfvars.example files, never the real ones.
.terraform/
.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
!gpu.tfvars.example
# Per-VM zone placement written by gcp/scripts/gpu_place.sh
placement.tfvars.json
# The lock file IS committed on purpose (pins provider versions for everyone).

# ── Secrets and credentials -- never commit ─────────────────────────────────
# Local settings loaded by the Makefiles (FAIG_LICENSE_POOL, FAIG_ADMIN_PASS,
# FAIG_ACME_EMAIL, FAIG_DNS_SA_SECRET, ...). The DNS-01 solver key lives in
# gcp/.env.dns-sa-key.json -- a live GCP service-account key.
.env
.env.*
*.lic
*.pem
*.key
# License-pool ledger (which serial is assigned to which VM)
faig_alloc.json*

# ── Fortinet-distributed artifacts -- not ours to redistribute ──────────────
# The FAIG helm chart tar is dropped into faig_seed/ by you (see README,
# Prerequisites). FAIG install tars likewise never live in this repo.
faig_seed/FAIG_helm_chart-*.tar

# ── Class data (student rosters, handouts, per-lab vars) ────────────────────
# These carry student identities and credentials.
class*.csv
*roster*
*.handout.*
handout*.csv
vars.*.yml
class_logins.csv

# ── OS / editor / tooling junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.logs/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
